# game/princess.rpy:2
translate english p_1_571210d1:

    # "我们走出庭院，去阿轩的房间还要些时间。 为了打破沉寂， 我开始找了个话题。"
    "We walked out the garden."
    "It takes some time to reach the room of Ah-Xuan. "
    "To break the silence, I started a conversation. "

# game/princess.rpy:3
translate english p_1_79647fbd:

    # mc_1 "原来六郎是仙君啊。我发现你时，看你孤身一人。难道是初到人间，没有朋友在身旁，但是为何不向人求助？"
    mc_1 "So, you are a deity? When I found you, you were alone. "
    mc_1 "Was it because it was your first time visiting the mortal realm and you had no friends?"
    mc_1 "Why didn't you ask for help?"

# game/princess.rpy:4
translate english p_1_d0e17896:

    # six "白天我用的仙法太多，身体有些疲惫。到了夜晚，本想找当地土地问话。可却被你拦下了。我不向凡人求助是因为仙人不得和凡人走的太近。"
    six "I used most of my magic powers that day, so I was too exhausted by the time you found me. "
    six "I was going to ask the Lord of the Soil and Ground for help, but you took me to an inn. "
    six "I usually don't ask mortals for help because I am not supposed to be friends with mortals."

# game/princess.rpy:5
translate english p_1_a4157bbd:

    # mc_1 "这又是为何？"
    mc_1 "Why is that again?"

# game/princess.rpy:6
translate english p_1_1166a9d1:

    # six "我的弟弟，七郎，和一个叫做董永的凡人成了亲。"
    six "My seventh brother, Qi Lang, married a mortal named Dong Yong."

# game/princess.rpy:7
translate english p_1_49a263d1:

    # six "可是天帝不许仙人与凡人有任何瓜葛。若是和凡人太亲近了， 我担心自己也会向弟弟一样，坠入凡尘，永世不得回天界。"
    six "But the Heavenly Emperor does not allow immortals to have any contact with mortals. "
    six "If I get too close to a mortal, I’m afraid that I will fall into the mortal world like my brother and never return to heaven."

# game/princess.rpy:8
translate english p_1_f1edd86b:

    # six "况且。。"
    six "Besides…"

# game/princess.rpy:9
translate english p_1_480b5717:

    # mc_1 "况且？"
    mc_1 "Besides?"

# game/princess.rpy:10
translate english p_1_42629176:

    # six "人世间也只有区区几十年，不过百年。 若是自己的好友过世了，还要受得轮回之苦。"
    six "There are only a few decades in the world, just a hundred years."
    six "If my friend dies, they will have to be reincarnated."

# game/princess.rpy:11
translate english p_1_5cfff2f2:

    # six "我虽是仙君，却不能救济好友，更不能为他们还阳续命。"
    six "Even though I am deity, I cannot help my friends, let alone expand their lifespan."

# game/princess.rpy:12
translate english p_1_98d5d694:

    # six "空有仙法却不能永世庇佑好友，在两难的情况下，心里怎么好受？"
    six "How can I feel at ease in a difficult situation when I am supposed to be so powerful, yet feeling so powerless?"

# game/princess.rpy:13
translate english p_1_79999f8e:

    # "我一直以为六郎是一个单纯的小傻子，但是今日一语才知他其实心里也装了许多事情。 不与凡人做朋友是因为不想对凡间有太多牵挂。"
    "I always thought Liu Lang was too naive and silly."
    "However, today I learned that he actually was just pretending and held a lot in his heart. "
    "He doesn't want to be a friend of mortals, because he doesn't want to worry too much about the mortal world."

# game/princess.rpy:14
translate english p_1_031a846f:

    # "其实不仅仙人对人世间的生死，悲欢离合有太多的畏惧，就连凡人自己也是对未来有着许多的未知。"
    "In fact, people of this world not only have too much fear of life and death, but also the separation of joys and sorrows"
    "And even immortals themselves can't always predict the future."

# game/princess.rpy:15
translate english p_1_c47e9946:

    # mc_1 "是不是等百年之后，六郎也会想着我？"
    mc_1 "Will you still think of me after a hundred years?"

# game/princess.rpy:16
translate english p_1_775598c8:

    # six "（神情渐渐低落）希望那一天晚一点再来。 我还想和公主多呆在一起久一些。"
    six "(His expression grows sadder) I hope that day shall never come."
    six "I also want to stay longer with you, Princess."

# game/princess.rpy:17
translate english p_1_45eff8c5:

    # mc_1 "拾起地上的花瓣）六郎明明说不想和凡人做朋友，可是心里其实很贪心。"
    mc_1 "(Picking some flowers from the ground) You said that you didn't want to be friends with mortals,"
    mc_1 "but your heart says otherwise."

# game/princess.rpy:18
translate english p_1_5f6f6ad9:

    # mc_1 "现在这花瓣白里透红的确是很美，但是枯萎的花怎么还有人会记得呢？"
    mc_1 "Right now, the petals are white and red. "
    mc_1 "They are still very beautiful, but who will remember the flower's beauty once it withers?"

# game/princess.rpy:19
translate english p_1_d1940627:

    # mc_1 "别说百年，若是二十年后，说不定六郎都不认得我了吧。"
    mc_1 "A hundred years is too long"
    mc_1 "even if it is just twenty years later, maybe you won't recognize me anymore."

# game/princess.rpy:20
translate english p_1_5ec2aab0:

    # six "公主何出此言？六郎绝不是那些肤浅的小人。 我自当会永远想念着和公主在一起的时间。"
    six "Why would you say that?"
    six "I am not a superficial deity. "
    six "I think I will always miss the time I spend with you."

# game/princess.rpy:21
translate english p_1_652475a0:

    # mc_1 "好啦，我只是开个玩笑。 怎么这么认真了？阿轩的房间到啦。 你可别提起自己的身份啊。"
    mc_1 "Okay, I'm just kidding. Why are you so serious? "
    mc_1 "Here is Ah-Xuan's room. Don't reveal your true identity. "

# game/princess.rpy:22
translate english p_1_a2102232:

    # "我们拜访了阿轩。 她的身子确实虚弱了许多。 我吩咐下去让她好好休养几日。"
    "We visited A-Xuan and her body really was much weaker. "
    "I told her to take some time to rest for a few days."

# game/princess.rpy:23
translate english p_1_3511f963:

    # mc_1 "六郎不是有这么多仙丹吗？ 那若是阿轩吃了仙丹之后是不是就恢复的比较快了？"
    mc_1 "Lui Lang, don't you have a lot of potions?"
    mc_1 "If Ah-Xuan took one, wouldn't she recover faster?"

# game/princess.rpy:24
translate english p_1_0b0a9f42:

    # six " 仙丹怎可给凡人来用？若是阿轩吃了仙丹，她就会有神力了。"
    six "How can a mortal use a potion? "
    six "If A-Xuan took one, she would have supernatural powers."

# game/princess.rpy:25
translate english p_1_8be8eb04:

    # mc_1 "就算如此，她与我情同姐妹，我不愿看她这么痛苦。 六郎一定有办法吧？"
    mc_1 "Still, she feels like a sister to me and I don't want to see her in so much pain."
    mc_1 "You must have a solution, right?"

# game/princess.rpy:26
translate english p_1_6a300701:

    # six " 也罢， 那就给她服用这枚丹丸。她的病迟迟未好，我也担心阿轩过不了这关。 食用丹药之后，很快就会恢复体力。"
    six "Fine, give her this medicine."
    six "She hasn't healed yet, and I am worried that she might not recover from this level of illness. "
    six "After taking it, she will recover."

# game/princess.rpy:27
translate english p_1_5327eb29:

    # six "若是凡人吃了，不仅延年益寿，而且稍有神力。 以后她也可以好好保护你"
    six "If a mortal takes it, not only will it prolong their life, it will also give them a little magical power. "
    six "She will also be able to protect you in the future."

# game/princess.rpy:30
translate english p_2_3f105cfa:

    # "我小心翼翼地守在大郎的床边，时不时为他擦去额头上的汗珠。"
    "I cautiously waited by Da Lang’s bedside, periodically wiping beads of sweat from his forehead."

# game/princess.rpy:31
translate english p_2_6f2445be:

    # "太医说从小看我长大，还没有这么关心一个人过。几个太监小声喃喃道，难道这个俊朗的陌生男子是未来的准驸马？"
    "The Imperial Doctor said that even when I was younger, I never cared so much about someone other than my parents."
    "Even a few eunuchs whispered about the possibility of this handsome stranger becoming my future husband."

# game/princess.rpy:32
translate english p_2_e1fda27e:

    # "被人议论还是有些尴尬的。听到这句话，我吩咐他们都出去。"
    "Hearing them talk like that made me feel awkward, so I made them all leave."

# game/princess.rpy:33
translate english p_2_ff838205:

    # "看着昏迷不醒的大郎，我越来越担心。 国师确实法力无边，就连天上的神仙都不是他的对手。如今大郎被打伤成这样，不知何年何月才能康复。"
    "Looking at the unconscious Da Lang, I became more and more worried. "
    "The Prime Minister is really strong, even the gods in heaven are not stronger than him. "
    "Da Lang is seriously injured, I don't know how long it will be before he recovers."

# game/princess.rpy:34
translate english p_2_d7f93a1a:

    # "我走到门边，隐约地听见了太医们的谈话。"
    "Walking to the door, I vaguely processed what the doctor was saying."

# game/princess.rpy:35
translate english p_2_84c2586d:

    # "\"看来这回是难逃一死了。真是可惜了，亏他还这么年轻。\""
    "\"This time it will be hard for him to make it. It is a pity, since he is still so young.\""

# game/princess.rpy:36
translate english p_2_2a9e6c35:

    # "什么？！ 不是说吃了丹药就不会有事了吗？怎么现在变成这样了？"
    "What? Didn't they say that if you take the potion it would be okay? Why is it different now?"

# game/princess.rpy:37
translate english p_2_d61bb616:

    # "原本他的冰块脸变得更没有血色了，我焦急得抓住了他冰冷的手。"
    "His cold, pale face looked bloodless in an instant, I grasped his cold hand anxiously."

# game/princess.rpy:38
translate english p_2_f6866033:

    # mc_1 "你一定要平安无事。"
    mc_1 "You have to be okay."

# game/princess.rpy:39
translate english p_2_4109390f:

    # "可是睡着的人并无任何反应。 从小到大，身为公主，我想要的东西应有尽有，可是这次我才感到真正的无助。"
    "But, he remained unresponsive."
    "As a Princess, I've had everything I wanted since I was a kid, but this time I truly felt helpless."

# game/princess.rpy:40
translate english p_2_1494e9a2:

    # "虽说是生死有命，难道想要他好好活着就这么困难吗？ 几滴泪水不受控制的落了下来。"
    "Although life and death are predetermined, am I asking for too much for him to be alive? "
    "A few tears streamed down my face involuntarily."

# game/princess.rpy:41
translate english p_2_3b8075b8:

    # "我看着屋内的许久未擦的神像，开始清理上面的污垢，诚心跪着祷告。"
    "There were many deity statues in the room that had clearly not been cleaned in a long time, so I began to clean them."
    "I kneeled and prayed sincerely."

# game/princess.rpy:42
translate english p_2_95f1fcaa:

    # mc_1 "请求天帝一定要保佑大郎平安无事。 若是能让大郎早日康复，阿凌愿意不要荣华富贵， 甚至这辈子也不嫁人了，青灯古佛，独自一人。"
    mc_1 "I asked the Heavenly Emperor to keep Da Lang safe and sound. "
    mc_1 "If he can recover soon, I will not look for prosperity or wealth and I will even refrain from marriage and be forever alone, following the ways of Buddha."

# game/princess.rpy:43
translate english p_2_0c1e1ed0:

    # one "（疑惑）你为何如此担心本尊？"
    one "(Doubtful) Why are you so worried about me?"

# game/princess.rpy:44
translate english p_2_3beb4aa1:

    # "回头一看，原来床上的人终于苏醒了。"
    "Looking back, I see he's finally conscious."

# game/princess.rpy:45
translate english p_2_4d26bad3:

    # mc_1 "（擦去泪水） 你终于醒了！我还以为。。还以为你这次永远都不会醒了。"
    mc_1 "(Wiping away the tears) You are awake at last!"
    mc_1 "I thought… I thought you would never wake up again."

# game/princess.rpy:46
translate english p_2_686d4b91:

    # one "（有些不解）本尊在世已久，听闻凡人最喜爱的莫过于荣华富贵，求得好姻缘了。为何你却宁愿抛弃这些只为换我的平安？"
    one "(Looking somewhat puzzled) I have lived for a long time and I have known mortals to only love  glory, wealth and even a happy marriage
    one "yet you would abandon them all for my well being. Why?"

# game/princess.rpy:47
translate english p_2_4a5b91dc:

    # mc_1 "大郎既然已经修道成仙，不必再受轮回之苦，那自然也能明白其中道理。"
    mc_1 "Since you’re a powerful deity who no longer needs to suffer the wheel of reincarnation"
    mc_1 "you must be more knowledgeable than mortals. Why don't you tell me instead?"

# game/princess.rpy:48
translate english p_2_3995423d:

    # "有那么一刹那，他白皙的脸渐渐透红。难道是脸红了？"
    "After a while, his pale face gradually turned red. Was he blushing?"

# game/princess.rpy:49
translate english p_2_da66b751:

    # one "天帝若是听到了你的请求，也必定不会答应你。人仙有别，我们注定无缘。 若是与人相恋，千年修为不仅毁于一旦，而且永世不得返回天庭。"
    one "If the Heavenly Emperor heard your prayers, he would not agree to your request. Immortals and humans are different, we have no chance to be together. "
    one "If I fall in love with a human girl, not only will my thousands of years of cultivation be destroyed,"
    one "but also I will never be able to return to the heavenly realm."

# game/princess.rpy:50
translate english p_2_8c05ede7:

    # mc_1 "（失望）若是大郎哪天真心喜欢我了，肯定会为今日之言感到后悔的。"
    mc_1 "(Disappointed) If you actually fall in love with me one day, you'll be forever sorry for what you said today."

# game/princess.rpy:51
translate english p_2_8159633c:

    # one "那你又是为什么爱慕本尊？"
    one "Then why do you adore me?"

# game/princess.rpy:52
translate english p_2_f6cb2059:

    # mc_1 "你和朝廷里那些谄媚的官员不一样。他们只想讨好我，完全因为我是公主罢了。 我觉得大郎虽然有些冷淡，但实则是外冷内热，是一个真性情的好郎君。"
    mc_1 "You are different from the court officials who only want to flatter me. "
    mc_1 "They try to please me, simply because I am a princess. "
    mc_1 "I think that you seem indifferent on the outside, but inside you are caring. I think you are genuine."

# game/princess.rpy:53
translate english p_2_d70c372e:

    # one "公主现在喜欢本尊只是因为我不是那些凡夫俗子。过些时日，等公主对我不再迷恋，说不定也会为今日之言感到后悔的。"
    one "You only like me now because I'm different from your peers. "
    one "With the passing of time, once you are no longer obsessed with me, you may regret your words today."

# game/princess.rpy:54
translate english p_2_fa2caa9a:

    # mc_1 "郎君何出此言？"
    mc_1 "Why would you say that?"

# game/princess.rpy:55
translate english p_2_16e14ef6:

    # one "公主今年二十有余，可本尊在世已有千年。 既是见过人间的悲欢离合，也明白人心易变。"
    one "You are a little over twenty, yet I have been alive for thousands of years."
    one "Not only have I seen the joys and sorrows of the world, but I also understand that the human heart is fickle."

# game/princess.rpy:56
translate english p_2_bfd067fe:

    # one "这世上唯有天道不曾更改，人间情爱也只是镜花水月罢了。"
    one "Nothing is immutable except our predetermined fate. "
    one "Love is just a beautiful illusion. It's inconstant."

# game/princess.rpy:57
translate english p_2_61cc0807:

    # "说完此话，他合上双眸，开始打坐。"
    "After he said this, he closed his eyes and began meditating."

# game/princess.rpy:58
translate english p_2_e547dca3:

    # mc_1 "你这个冰块脸，本公主不理你了。"
    mc_1 "You're too relentless, I am just going to ignore you."

# game/princess.rpy:59
translate english p_2_a7d48009:

    # "我的心好像被什么戳痛了似的，可是却不想在他的面前落泪。"
    "My heart ached for some reason, but I wasn't going to cry in front of him."

# game/princess.rpy:60
translate english p_2_03472b4d:

    # "看来让一个仙君爱上凡人其实不是那么容易的事情。这千年里他是不是遇见过什么人？"
    "I guess it isn’t easy to make an Immortal fall in love with a human. "
    "I wonder in these thousand years, has he ever spent time with anyone?"

# game/princess.rpy:61
translate english p_2_c4d61188:

    # "难不成曾经有某个女孩子让他伤了心？ 现在想起来，我确实对这个仙君还有许多不了解的地方。"
    "Is it possible that a girl once made him sad? "
    "Now that I think about it, there is a lot about this Immortal that I don't know."

# game/princess.rpy:62
translate english p_2_9bd991be:

    # "一出门就看见了刚才的两位太医。"
    "As soon as I left, I saw two Imperial doctors."

# game/princess.rpy:63
translate english p_2_df1fe374:

    # "我出去询问太医为何说大郎命不久矣，他们才回复，其实刚才他们说的是另一个年轻的太医。。。原来是我听错了？"
    "I went over and asked one of them, why did they falsely report Da Lang's health condition, to which they replied quickly. "
    "In fact they were talking about another young Imperial doctor… So, I heard it wrong?"

# game/princess.rpy:66
translate english p_3_e1fc870d:

    # "今天又是一个祭祀的一天。 这回父王说我必须要参加典礼，无奈之下我才许可。"
    "Today is another day of sacrifice. This time my father said that I must attend the ceremony, so I have no choice but to go."

# game/princess.rpy:67
translate english p_3_4f3aa22f:

    # "妖风吹过香炉，血腥的味道慢慢散开，我也感到不适。"
    "As the demon winds pass through the incense burner, the smell of blood dissipates; still I feel uncomfortable."

# game/princess.rpy:68
translate english p_3_de8dfcad:

    # npc1 "今日我用了十个童男童女的血来供给魔君， 陛下可放心，西凉百年都不会有灾难。 只是。。。"
    npc1 "Today, I used the blood of ten boys and girls to offer to the demon,"
    npc1 "you can rest assured that there will not be any disasters in Xiliang for a hundred years. However..."

# game/princess.rpy:69
translate english p_3_7c276d84:

    # npc2 "只是什么？"
    npc2 "However, what?"

# game/princess.rpy:70
translate english p_3_5f800626:

    # npc1 "微臣方才卜了一卦，公主和西凉的命数有必要的关系。若是公主能在这个月出嫁，那么她可保西凉的太平。"
    npc1 "Your humble servant just had a divination, the princess and Xiliang's fates are intertwined."
    npc1 "If the princess can marry this month, then she can protect Xiliang's peace."

# game/princess.rpy:71
translate english p_3_ebefc82a:

    # npc2 " 还有此事？"
    npc2 "Are you sure?"

# game/princess.rpy:72
translate english p_3_214358e7:

    # npc1 "微臣只是善于卜卦，听从天意。"
    npc1 "Your humble servant is only good at reading signs and obeys the will of the Gods."

# game/princess.rpy:73
translate english p_3_7713fe91:

    # mc_1 "天意会索要童男童女之命？ 国师不要在这里危言耸听了。"
    mc_1 "Why would any gods ask for the blood of children?"
    mc_1 "The Prime Minister needs to stop lying."

# game/princess.rpy:74
translate english p_3_ad8e9a2e:

    # npc1 "谁都知道，大多数西凉子民不信神，不拜佛，只信奉魔尊。若是连尊上的话都不听了，那么西凉的未来还有什么可言？"
    npc1 "Everyone knows, most of the people in Xiliang don't believe in gods or worship Buddha, they only believe in the demons."
    npc1 "If you don't listen to your Demon Lord, what future is there for Xiliang?"

# game/princess.rpy:75
translate english p_3_3f81e1ea:

    # npc2 "好了，阿凌，这件事你可不许胡闹。 国师说的确实有理。 魔尊保佑我们这么多年，虽然祭祀是牺牲了性命，但是能保佑整个国家也是值得了。"
    npc2 "Alright, Ah Ling, you can't mess around about this matter. What the Prime Minister said is indeed reasonable."
    npc2 "The Demon Lord has blessed us for so many years. "
    npc2 "Even though the rituals sacrificed lives, it was worth it to bless the whole country."

# game/princess.rpy:76
translate english p_3_586a93b4:

    # npc1 "若是你不能在一个月内找到驸马，那还不如让朕来安排."
    npc1 "If you can't find a prince consort within the month, just let me arrange it."

# game/princess.rpy:77
translate english p_3_f59a4b04:

    # mc_1 "我的亲事才不要父王来安排。反正就一个月，我就不信一个月内找不到驸马。"
    mc_1 "Stay out of my marriage, father. Just a month, I will find a prince consort in a month."

# game/princess.rpy:78
translate english p_3_cd4391ce:

    # "虽然很不乐意，我不得不遵守父亲的命令"
    "Even though I am very upset, I must obey my father's orders."

# game/princess.rpy:79
translate english p_3_4c4c4b35:

    # "在人群中，我在角落好像看到一人。 他微微一笑，和我相视时，让我不敢相信原来他会出现在这里。"
    "In the crowd, I see someone at the corner. "
    "When I looked at him, he smiled at me."
    "I can't believe that he would show up here."

# game/princess.rpy:80
translate english p_3_401f2ff9:

    # "祭祀结束后， 我悄悄溜走。 希望能与他交谈。"
    "After the ceremony ended, I slipped away quietly, hoping to talk with him."

# game/princess.rpy:81
translate english p_3_2ddd1dd1:

    # mc_1 "（有些吃惊） 二郎？ 你怎么会在皇宫里？ 这回我可没有读什么诗句啊？"
    mc_1 "(Somewhat Shocked) Er Lang? Why are you in the palace?"
    mc_1 "I didn't have to read any of the poem verses?"

# game/princess.rpy:82
translate english p_3_3636273d:

    # two "(不敢相信）你能看见我？"
    two "(Seeming more surprised than me) Can you see me?"

# game/princess.rpy:83
translate english p_3_7ee6a9de:

    # mc_1 "为何不能？"
    mc_1 "Why wouldn't I be able to see you?"

# game/princess.rpy:84
translate english p_3_c8bde03c:

    # two "这就怪了。除非。。。（看着我的衣袖）你有什么宝物？"
    two "This is odd. Unless…  (He looks at my sleeve) What treasure do you have?"

# game/princess.rpy:85
translate english p_3_f55207f1:

    # mc_1 "我身为公主，自然宝物多的是了。"
    mc_1 "As a princess, it's not unusual that I own many treasures."

# game/princess.rpy:86
translate english p_3_aa7327af:

    # "二郎双手一挥，我袖子里的定水珠就闪闪发亮。过了片刻才失去光芒。"
    "Er Lang waved his hands, and the crystal pearl ball on my sleeve glistened. "
    "It took a while before it lost its glimmer."

# game/princess.rpy:87
translate english p_3_907cae31:

    # two "原来是此物啊。 呵，真是巧了。 公主的宝物看起来不像凡尘之物，这是如何得来的？"
    two "Oh, it's the crystal ball. What a coincidence. "
    two "Princess, your treasure doesn't look like it belongs to the mortal realm. How did you get this?"

# game/princess.rpy:88
translate english p_3_e7bc0296:

    # mc_1 "这是好友相赠，那你呢？ 二郎还没有回答我的问题呢。"
    mc_1 "This was a gift from a friend, but what about you? You haven't answered my question yet."

# game/princess.rpy:89
translate english p_3_2056e4c2:

    # two "嗯？ 今天不是祭天大典吗？ 哈哈，小生就是来这里凑个热闹。"
    two "Ah? Isn't today the ceremony to worship the heavens? "
    two "Haha, I am just here to join the crowd and have some fun."

# game/princess.rpy:90
translate english p_3_6b9ad1f3:

    # mc_1 "（怀疑）不，你肯定不是说的真话。我还以为自从那次离别之后，二郎还会想着我。。。多日不见，是否连我的名字都忘了？"
    mc_1 "(I don't believe him) No, you are definitely not telling me the truth."
    mc_1 "I thought that after you left, you would still think about me. "
    mc_1 "So many days have passed, have you even forgotten my name?"

# game/princess.rpy:91
translate english p_3_f9ea9dbd:

    # two "若是不想, 怎么会来这里呢？ 阿凌的名字小生怎会忘了？"
    two "Would I be here, if I did not want to be here?"
    two "How could I forget your name?"

# game/princess.rpy:92
translate english p_3_6bf7e7cc:

    # mc_1 "那你可知我在一个月内就要嫁人了？"
    mc_1 "Do you know that I have to get married within a month?"

# game/princess.rpy:93
translate english p_3_207bf632:

    # two "若是如此，那就有些可惜了。"
    two "If so, it would be a shame."

# game/princess.rpy:94
translate english p_3_d2632663:

    # mc_1 "嗯？为何可惜？"
    mc_1 "Oh? Why would it be a shame?"

# game/princess.rpy:95
translate english p_3_5552191c:

    # two "这么可爱的姑娘要嫁作他人妇，这还不可惜啊？"
    two "Such a cute girl has to get married and be someone's wife."
    "Is that not a shame?"

# game/princess.rpy:96
translate english p_3_b3034b7e:

    # "虽然我猜他只是打趣我才这么说， 但是我的脸还是微微泛红。"
    "Even though he was just joking around with me, my face still turned red."

# game/princess.rpy:97
translate english p_3_62b15e5c:

    # mc_1 "二郎就别打趣我了。这些日子还要和大臣之子们相亲，想想就觉得烦心。"
    mc_1 "Er Lang, stop teasing me. I will have to start going on dates with the minister's sons."

# game/princess.rpy:98
translate english p_3_6fe0f889:

    # two "若是阿凌觉得烦心，那过些时日，在下可带你出去游玩。"
    two "If you get bored later, I can take you out sightseeing."

# game/princess.rpy:99
translate english p_3_b57d46a4:

    # two "我在帝都多日，听到百鸟啼叫，本是喜事，却也看见地方官员的腐败制度，民不聊生。 这和上次来拜访的时候差的太多了。"
    two "I have been in the Imperial Capital many days, hearing the birds singing. "
    two "This was supposed to be a harbinger of good things, but I also saw the corruption of the local officials. "
    two "The people don't have any way to make a living. This is very different from the last time I visited."

# game/princess.rpy:100
translate english p_3_dba75cb0:

    # mc_1 "上一次你来京都是什么时候？"
    mc_1 "When was the last time you came to the Imperial Capital?"

# game/princess.rpy:101
translate english p_3_c9d21b7f:

    # two "五百多。。。（突然想到什么）"
    two "Over five hundred… (He stopped abruptly, thinking about something)"

# game/princess.rpy:102
translate english p_3_c114addd:

    # mc_1 "嗯？ 五百多什么？"
    mc_1 "Um? Over five hundred what?"

# game/princess.rpy:103
translate english p_3_0ca9ae9c:

    # two "自然是五百多天前了。哈哈， 难不成是五百多年吗？"
    two "Naturally it was five hundred days ago. Haha, how could it be five hundred years later, right?"

# game/princess.rpy:104
translate english p_3_fa0218c7:

    # mc_1 "（感叹) 五百多年前的西凉还信奉神仙，而现在贵族们都只信邪魔歪道了。之前保佑我们的北冥帝君也不再出现了。"
    mc_1 "(I sighed deeply) Five hundred years ago, Xiliang still believed in the Immortals, "
    mc_1 "but now the nobles only follow evil ways. The Netherland Emperor, who once blessed us, is forever gone."

# game/princess.rpy:105
translate english p_3_652aac5d:

    # two "北冥那个地方不仅人烟稀少，而且还常年下雪。 说不定神仙们也不想去那里上任呢。"
    two "The Netherlands is not only sparsely populated, but it also snows all year long."
    two "Maybe the Immortals don't want to take office there, either."

# game/princess.rpy:106
translate english p_3_d67decd2:

    # mc_1 "说的好像二郎去过似的，那里尘封了十万恶鬼，普通人怎会去那里呢。"
    mc_1 "It sounds as if you have been there, there are one hundred thousand evil spirits there."
    mc_1 "How can ordinary people go there?"

# game/princess.rpy:107
translate english p_3_fd75c1f1:

    # two "你知道的挺多的嘛。那我问问你，昨日这皇宫里可有出现什么特别的人？阿凌可有撞见谁？"
    two "You know a lot. Let me ask you this, did anyone special show up at the palace yesterday?"
    two "Who did you come across?"

# game/princess.rpy:108
translate english p_3_5407efdb:

    # "难道他是在暗示大郎不成？"
    "Could he be referring to Da Lang?"

# game/princess.rpy:109
translate english p_3_fb6743fc:

    # mc_1 "怎么了？"
    mc_1 "Who do you mean?"

# game/princess.rpy:110
translate english p_3_48f22a4b:

    # "无事。小生还有些事要去办，今日撞见公主实乃巧合。 下一次若是有缘再见吧。"
    "Nothing. I still have some things to get done, I happened to see you by chance."
    "If it is destined, I will see you next time."

# game/princess.rpy:111
translate english p_3_ac637f67:

    # "看他走的这么急，我也不好留住他。 现在祭祀已经结束了， 我有些心不在焉地在宫里散步。 还没等我走到阿轩的住处，我就听见了嬉笑的声音。"
    "Seeing him leave in such a hurry, I just can't keep him here."
    "With the ritual over, I wander through the palace, in a daze. "
    "The sound of laughter filters through the air as I get to Ah-Xuan's room."

# game/princess.rpy:112
translate english p_3_d176a56f:

    # " 站在门外，我才发现原来是六郎吹着泡泡，逗得阿轩很是欣喜。夕阳下， 两人的影子倒映在宫廷的白墙上，就如恋人一般。"
    "From outside, I see that Liu Lang is blowing bubbles, much to Ah-Xuan's delight. "
    "The rays of the sunset cast the reflection of their shadows across the white walls of the court, like lovers."

# game/princess.rpy:113
translate english p_3_2badac79:

    # "看着六郎这么认真，而且刚刚大病初愈的阿轩如此欢喜，我也不好打扰他们。"
    "Seeing Liu Lang super focused, and Ah-Xuan so happy"
    "After just recovering from her serious illness, I don't want to interrupt them."

# game/princess.rpy:114
translate english p_3_4a12ca7f:

    # "虽然站在同一片天空下，此情此景，我总觉得现在不应该留在这里。顿时， 我感到-"
    "Although we are all under the same sky, at this  moment, I feel like I don't belong here right now. Suddenly, I feel-"

# game/princess.rpy:117
translate english p_3_e7149ac3:

    # "为何我总觉得心里有些空空的，好像失去了什么重要的人？如今的六郎是不是已经不是我的小傻子了？"
    "Why does my heart feel empty, as if I have lost someone very important?"
    "Is it because Liu Lang is no longer my \"little fool\"?"

# game/princess.rpy:118
translate english p_3_4b6e5c17:

    # "他是不是已经喜欢上其他人了？ 明明雨夜之时，他还对我如此上心，不过几日，难道他就变心了？"
    "Has he already fallen in love with someone else? "
    "The night of the storm, he was so concerned about me, but now, in just a few days' time, has he changed his mind?"

# game/princess.rpy:121
translate english p_3_ebb66771:

    # "若是如此，六郎和阿轩说不定也是有缘分在一起。 一个仙君为了凡人，不惜打破天庭规矩， 还真是羡煞旁人。"
    "If that is true, then maybe Liu Lang and Ah Xuan are destined to be together."
    "An Immortal who would not hesitate to defy the laws of heaven, for a mortal, will surely be envied by others."

# game/princess.rpy:122
translate english p_3_d3ea1359:

    # "如此一来，这和神话里的七郎和董永一样让人羡慕。"
     "Just like Qi Lang and Dong Yong, Ah-Xuan and Liu Lang will probably also end up as a couple."

# game/princess.rpy:126
translate english p_4_6c57ee53:

    # "这一次，我决定自己一人出宫。还记得昔日九妹送给我的定水珠，我有些好奇地去了东海湾，想一试此物。"
    "This time, I decided to leave the palace alone."
    "I remembered the water pearl that Jiu Mei gave to me."
    "Out of curiosity, I went to the Eastern Sea to try it out."

# game/princess.rpy:127
translate english p_4_09bcd4d4:

    # "可是我却不知如何运用神仙的宝物。 站在海边许久，我有些迟疑应该如何是好。"
    "However, I don't know how to use the treasures of Immortals. "
    "I stood on the beach for a long time, hesitating about what I should do."

# game/princess.rpy:128
translate english p_4_780984b3:

    # "这时，一个陌生男子的声音从附近传来。"
    "Then, I heard a man's voice nearby."

# game/princess.rpy:129
translate english p_4_cd95d08c:

    # boy "姑娘且慢！"
    boy "Lady, wait a minute!"

# game/princess.rpy:130
translate english p_4_b6baed44:

    # "转过头来，我有些疑惑的看着旁边的少年。他刚好拉住我的衣袖。"
    "I turned to look, confused. There stood a youth. "
    "He just grabbed my sleeve."

# game/princess.rpy:131
translate english p_4_34a3e4ad:

    # mc_1 "你这是做甚？"
    mc_1 "What are you doing?"

# game/princess.rpy:132
translate english p_4_98c1f653:

    # boy "姑娘可不要想不开。一切都好商量。你这么年轻，而且还美丽动人，怎可寻死？"
    boy "Don't take things too hard. Everything is negotiable."
    boy "You are so young and beautiful, why are you seeking death?"

# game/princess.rpy:133
translate english p_4_2ed0bccd:

    # mc_1 "什么？你以为我要寻死？本公主只是不知如何入海而已。反正你也不懂。"
    mc_1 "What? You think I am here looking to die?"
    mc_1 "This princess here simply can't figure out how to get into the sea. "
    mc_1 "You don't understand, anyway."

# game/princess.rpy:134
translate english p_4_f270b868:

    # boy "你是公主？哈哈，那正好我是太子。想要入海，姑娘可知神通？"
    boy "You are a princess? Haha, well, it just so happens that I am the crown prince."
    boy "If you want to enter the sea, you must have magical powers."

# game/princess.rpy:135
translate english p_4_05d8fa73:

    # mc_1 "哼，你竟然藐视皇权。本公主不和你一般见识。神通略知一二。"
    mc_1 "Humph, how dare you, slighting a royal."
    mc_1 "I don't have time to be upset with you today. "
    mc_1 "I only know a little about magical powers."

# game/princess.rpy:136
translate english p_4_d72d4a2a:

    # mc_1 "（看着他手上的贺礼）怎么，你带着这么多东西来海边？"
    mc_1 "(Looking at the gifts in his hand) So, why did you come to the beach with so many things?"

# game/princess.rpy:137
translate english p_4_8879bd9d:

    # boy "若是知晓神通，何不大显身手？这些贺礼是送给亲戚的礼物，今日家中老者大寿，自然是要孝敬老人家。"
    boy "Well, if you know magical powers, why not show your skills?"
    boy "These gifts are for relatives."
    boy "When the elders of the family celebrate their birthday, naturally we have to show them respect."

# game/princess.rpy:138
translate english p_4_a775e0ca:

    # mc_1 "你说什么我就非得听不成？这不是把人当猴耍吗？"
    mc_1 "Why should I listen to you? Are you trying to make a monkey out of me?"

# game/princess.rpy:139
translate english p_4_87427b6f:

    # boy "哈哈，我可不敢惹猴子。上一次认识的那个猴王都已经得到真身。公主想要入海可是需要宝物的。"
    boy "Haha, I don’t dare mess with monkeys. "
    boy "The Monkey King I met last already achieved nirvana. "
    boy "If you want to enter the sea as a mortal, then you will need some celestial items."

# game/princess.rpy:140
translate english p_4_40f8ef4e:

    # mc_1 "不就是定水珠吗？本公主多的是。"
    mc_1 "Like a crystal ball or water pearl? I have many of them."

# game/princess.rpy:141
translate english p_4_087b310e:

    # boy "（疑惑）你。。。真有此物？"
    boy "(Still doubtful) You…really own such a thing?"

# game/princess.rpy:142
translate english p_4_4ab798bf:

    # "他摆了摆袖子，不到片刻，定水珠就从我的袖子里飞出来了。"
    "He swung his sleeves, and within a flash, the water pearls flew out of my sleeves."

# game/princess.rpy:143
translate english p_4_2def2799:

    # mc_1 "你懂得妖法？还不赶快将其还给本公主！"
    mc_1 "You know dark magic? Give it back to me, now!"

# game/princess.rpy:144
translate english p_4_18c62b59:

    # "此乃神通，不是妖法。还给你，那好啊。要是姑娘能拿到此物，我就还给你。"
    "It is magic, but not dark magic. "
    "You can have it back, alright. If you can reach this, I'll give it back to you."

# game/princess.rpy:145
translate english p_4_c1d2a6a0:

    # "这个少年还真能折腾，本来就是和他完全无关的事情都要来凑热闹。"
    "This young guy really has too much time on his hands."
    "This had nothing to do with him and he just had to put his nose in my business and make things harder for me."

# game/princess.rpy:146
translate english p_4_a7debaf3:

    # "我有些不耐烦了，本想踮着脚去拿浮在空中的珠子，奈何每当我的手指碰触到表面时，珠子的高度又上升了。"
    "I was getting impatient."
    "I tried to tiptoe to reach the pearl floating above, but whenever my fingers touched the surface, it rose higher again."

# game/princess.rpy:147
translate english p_4_ac1f5b3b:

    # mc_1 "你分明就是耍赖！"
    mc_1 "Hey, you're cheating!"

# game/princess.rpy:148
translate english p_4_0d309e07:

    # boy "哈哈，公主应当运用些仙法才是，不然是拿不到这定水珠的。"
    boy "Haha, You should use some Immortal magic, otherwise you won't be able to get the water pearl."

# game/princess.rpy:149
translate english p_4_f5cdd50c:

    # "看来他是故意为难我的。看我怎么整治这个少年。"
    "He is deliberately trying to embarrass me."
    "Let's just see how I shall punish this youngster."

# game/princess.rpy:150
translate english p_4_4eaad5ce:

    # mc_1 "这有何难？只需借郎君的一只腿来用便好。"
    mc_1 "Is it really that difficult? I'll just borrow one of your legs and use it."

# game/princess.rpy:151
translate english p_4_dc2e9552:

    # boy "嗯？姑娘这是何意啊？"
    boy "Huh? What do you mean, lady?"

# game/princess.rpy:152
translate english p_4_1a1d9306:

    # "虽说现在仙法还不行，但是我的武术还是能排得上用场的。"
    "I may not know Immortal magic, but my martial arts can still be of use."

# game/princess.rpy:153
translate english p_4_97564705:

    # "我轻盈的踢着他的左腿，接着高度跳上了上空，不费九牛二虎之力就拿到了定水珠。"
    "I kicked his left leg lightly, then jumped into the air, reaching the water pearl easily."

# game/princess.rpy:154
translate english p_4_d657d926:

    # boy "（吃痛）你这姑娘怎么如此刁蛮。"
    boy "(In pain) Lady, why do you have to be so violent?"

# game/princess.rpy:155
translate english p_4_46e61334:

    # mc_1 "（得意洋洋）还不是因为你这个无名小卒想要挑战本公主的耐心。"
    mc_1 "(Triumphantly) It would be because you, a nobody, decided to challenge the patience of a princess."

# game/princess.rpy:156
translate english p_4_a7789bf1:

    # boy "无名小卒？本太子在世还是第一次被人称作无名小卒。那好，今日我就带你入海。"
    boy "A nobody? That is the first time that I, a crown prince, have ever been called a nobody."
    boy "Well, today, I will take you into the sea."

# game/princess.rpy:157
translate english p_4_a36f8005:

    # boy "这样你也可告知是如何得来龙宫的宝物。"
    boy "This way, you can also tell me how you got the treasure of the Dragon Palace."

# game/princess.rpy:158
translate english p_4_3d01ad15:

    # "如果他真能带我入海，那也正好如我所愿。我点了点头，他的嘴角轻轻上扬"
    "If he can really take me into the sea, I will go along with what he says. "
    "I nodded, then the corners of his mouth raised slightly."

# game/princess.rpy:159
translate english p_4_50a1b6fe:

    # "还没等我反应过来，就拉着我的手腕，双双跳进了海里。"
    "Before I could even react, he pulled my wrist and we both jumped into the sea."

# game/princess.rpy:160
translate english p_4_27864ad2:

    # "原本我还害怕自己不能呼吸，可是在水下之后，我才发现自己其实可以在水里呼吸。"
    "At first I was afraid that I wouldn't be able to breathe" 
    "but I then realized I could actually breathe under the water."

# game/princess.rpy:161
translate english p_4_f68c3091:

    # "这个少年水性极好，不仅带着我游到海底深处，而且我们很快就到了龙宫。"
    "This young man was a good swimmer"
    "not only did he take me to the deepest parts of the sea, but in no time, we were quickly at the Dragon Palace."

# game/princess.rpy:162
translate english p_4_b4204096:

    # "附近的虾兵蟹将看到我身旁的男子都恭敬地打了招呼，这整个龙宫和皇宫的设计也有些相似。"
    "Looking to the man beside me, the shrimp and crab soldiers greet me respectfully."
    "The design of the Dragon Palace is similar to that of the Imperial Palace."

# game/princess.rpy:163
translate english p_4_9e55c65b:

    # "我虽然不去龙王庙上香，但是现在才突然记起来是龙王的大寿。"
    "I don’t usually go to the Dragon King Temple to offer incense, but I suddenly recalled that it was the Dragon King's birthday today."

# game/princess.rpy:164
translate english p_4_e069b9d2:

    # "今日虽然来了许多神仙祝贺，但是我在远处就发现了九妹。 看来这个少年真的是仙人。"
    "Though many Immortals came over to greet me, today, I noticed Jiu Mei in the distance. "
    "I guess that this young man really is an Immortal."

# game/princess.rpy:165
translate english p_4_f5447352:

    # mc_1 "你到底是谁？"
    mc_1 "Who are you?"

# game/princess.rpy:166
translate english p_4_c7505bee:

    # boy "姑娘在岸上就已经问我这个问题了。我乃是西海储君，摩昂太子。"
    boy "You already asked me this on the beach. "
    boy "I am the crown prince of the Western Sea, Prince Mo’ang."

# game/princess.rpy:167
translate english p_4_583f4f06:

    # dude9 "数百年前，我的弟弟小白龙曾拜高僧玄奘为师，并与其一起西行取得真经。"
    dude9 "Hundreds of years ago, my little brother, the White Dragon, once worshiped the famous Monk Xuan Zang, his teacher, "
    dude9 "and they went West to obtain holy scriptures."

# game/princess.rpy:168
translate english p_4_530cecf5:

    # "原来他是西海太子，看来这少年倒是来头不小。"
    "So, he really is the Prince of the Western Sea. This young man came from a prominent background."

# game/princess.rpy:169
translate english p_4_c3b213fd:

    # "九妹见到我满是欣喜。"
    "Jiu Mei was very happy to see me."

# game/princess.rpy:170
translate english p_4_0bd6332f:

    # f1 "阿凌姐姐终于来找我玩了！咦？怎么姐姐也与表兄相识？"
    f1 "Sister Ah Ling finally came to see me! What? How did my sister come to know my cousin?"

# game/princess.rpy:177
translate english p_5_f8046ce1:

    # f1 "原来如此。表兄仙术高强，法力无边，他倒是能教你好多仙术。"
    f1 "That’s how you got here. My cousin is highly skilled and powerful, his magical power is limitless."
    f1 "He can teach you a lot of Immortal techniques."

# game/princess.rpy:178
translate english p_5_4fe8668a:

    # dude9 "九妹悟性极高，不仅与佛有缘，而且能看懂无字天书。 "
    dude9 "Jiu Mei has a very high comprehension level, not only does she follow Buddha, she can also understand the sacred scriptures."

# game/princess.rpy:179
translate english p_5_d3464655:

    # dude9 "我虽然有些神通，但是论天赋，还是九妹更胜一筹。"
    dude9 "Although I have some supernatural abilities, in terms of talents, Jiu Mei is better."

# game/princess.rpy:180
translate english p_5_cdb5a806:

    # mc_1 "（挑了挑眉）看来太子殿下还是挺谦虚的嘛。"
    mc_1  "(Raising eyebrow) So Your Highness is actually humble."

# game/princess.rpy:181
translate english p_5_c10e546e:

    # dude9 "自是比公主殿下谦虚。"
    dude9 "I am definitely more humble than Your Grace."

# game/princess.rpy:182
translate english p_5_2164af0e:

    # mc_1 "啊，我突然想起来，今日是老龙王寿辰，我却既没有拜帖，又没携带礼物。怎么说都是失了礼数。"
    mc_1 "Ah, I just remembered that today is the birthday of the Old Dragon King and I do not have a card, or a gift for him. "
    mc_1 "It is so rude of me."

